# Images built from the repository root (docker/images/, Dockerfile.mcp, the
# demo apps) never receive secrets or local state: settings reach a container
# as environment variables or through a secret adapter, not as files.
# `.git` stays: the release image reads its version from the tags.
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
# The CLI's .env templates, which `abi new project` and `abi deploy local`
# render in the released image.
!libs/naas-abi-cli/naas_abi_cli/cli/deploy/templates/local/.env
!libs/naas-abi-cli/naas_abi_cli/cli/new/templates/project/.env
**/.venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
storage/
.abi-backups/
.snapshots/
.abi/stack/
.dagster/
